# Build output
bin/
obj/
build/out/
publish/

# The finished single-file executable, which publish.cmd copies up to the project root.
# 119 MB — self-contained builds embed the whole .NET runtime. Ships as a release asset, not in git.
CouchSession.exe
*.zip

# Local snapshots kept inside the project folder. The csproj already excludes these from
# compilation; this keeps them out of history as well.
_backup*/
_to_delete/
*.bak

# Optional embedded assets, deliberately not in the repository.
#
# The console button artwork is trademarked and cannot be redistributed here — the app draws its own
# marks when these are absent, which is the shipping behaviour. Drop your own copies beside the csproj
# if you have the rights to them.
ps-button.png
xbox-button.png

